{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 938,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19dc12470f4e5f8eb1c80510",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道以及往后位于前方时\\n短时间内速度大幅提升,如果是\\n中距离比赛则改变效果\\n短时间内向前大幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bdc11df447ee0612a8d8e50bfc7bc7a2b6bd1d25574270e9b01f53b2841fb0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67b1984a208ba70eebc28c5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘在队伍中间位置超越过对手\\n则在第三弯道时短时间内提升速度\\n如果是2400ｍ的比赛且自身高人气\\n则持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5b133f7720eedcf9d980d9381195b0bd8bac172e3551c4209443b6571b5b9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0aac815c9a143725ad01e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在中距离比赛的最终弯道\\n位于队伍中间,则向前突进\\n如果是东京竞马场的比赛\\n则大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "894e7998edb423a10430def4d1a0dd0dc6afc0631b9732bdbf0379f29b78f858",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8077493834f615e85a75a31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛的半程左右若位于中间位置\\n则短时间内速度少量提升,之后若在终盘的弯道进行过竞争,则在剩余350m的位置短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "66cd63a78a5db9a30e1b0b244f41d834b7faf6e90d06ebd244da1ebb6e5ba4b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697e52ae8c32b152217ba0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间位置时若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度提升,若为短距离比赛\\n则一段时间内稍微向前突进＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b64ed1a9fd9e47f9f7f0ee381ee985f3cb09d983966b9a8cdba76159a24fc2fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729b59d3674aaa4052af52d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中盘的弯道处位于有利位置\\n则回复体力\\n若是中长距离比赛\\n则额外少量持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb4b8fb384823b5dc6ad84d7280638466c2543b25c631c6dedc8c811e00583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e99e14bbba5ebecaf64766",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段速度会提升\\n如果没有起跑失误并且保持在前方\\n速度会大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e3ab09488740fa6be3552f717e0d90b7eb7a6650017ff373fb6d1b26e92df65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3676526f3d1ef50d5ad5c1e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘以后在下坡路段处于中间集团，则下坡后将在较长时间\\n内持续小幅提升速度、极少量提升\\n加速力，效果期间发动技能3次\\n之内加速力会增加＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "944d8e61dc26d674d568a2389712d5ace165a6a0e42e4921c2567c2ca97cb346",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5808466587a9c59d951b3bf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的弯道位于后方时\\n若距离终点尚远则短时间内向前突进\\n如果是中山竞马场的中距离比赛\\n则提高效果量并额外提升微量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "962e9b06b4b02392a4ae906f11c0d2e07c369eed93728c64216a70ba2bfd4f78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3554d982607a953747ea76b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道及往后,自身位于中后方时\\n一段时间内速度大幅提升\\n若是中距离比赛则改变效果\\n一段时间内迅速向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24c1526dc95b5f2a4576f719bdee8fb3706a8bb13159fce900131e80a7f47ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9b7db98c9e6bb000e0a315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛进入最后600m,并在队伍中间\\n从外道超越对手,则最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2db8f9a7cbf3f0c6cce70560d33686ed517e39a256d841976d76bcef8d46e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:775098e6d59329141bed6241",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处位于队伍中间时\\n速度少量提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd82de73cced2889a503992287cbbd30e75edfec184bc37d702de892e4f683e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd22519a2d5be6b2608c4ef3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "序盘以及中盘在前方被超越或进行竞争时\\n短时间内提升速度,若是长距离比赛\\n则在比赛后半段位于前二名时\\n速度少量持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d657770ff5e314ebd160bf845838f41ee29192a06271e0f1191e6f244195e6c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89cc7331988d2603c9516f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘后的最终直线上若位于队伍中间,则速度\\n提升,此外若是中距离或长距离比赛\\n且在中盘被超越过的话\\n稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2f8d74b6642f56aa71f36439e0c05ac646e9ab7676757c35ee6ee1cae2feb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba920421669baf558a296744",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过技能回复3次以上耐力时\\n在紧临终盘前的位置向前突进\\n此外技能发动时若位于前方\\n则加速度稍微提升＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "940b12a4dbf948fec9c6a60f243821ea0daea0b41aceb7647612f9925829abca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227a68ff3bff408d4bd17369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出赛状态若是为绝好调则所有基础能力提升\\n在比赛中不易受到技能的不利效果\\n并且比赛中加速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0c9f72099cea9142c99d403b0354587741b5e13420e6a5bfa07032827275f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f5e764a6e68f734dd0db30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "天气状况为晴且马场状况良好时\\n所有基础能力大幅提升\\n且比赛中加速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff651c794dc007e9f2061c59e59d20c67491d79c96c7b24b68083e2afaca37d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a397e5bfe8efd91b373f3b96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "天气状况为雨且马场状况不良时\\n速度与耐力超大幅提升\\n并且比赛中加速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "019e30f525d678e83d70909526c8a541bc63708aa441e0b92417092679a5edc8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551ad51b4fb671af5af78337",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若枠号为1～3,则出闸后的一段时间内\\n速度与加速度持续小幅提升；\\n在终盘时直线加速度小幅提升并回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13786d569e8acaa9c065ea97c5ac6e01010f47bf4d8570b4e6890dcad42e253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d0990b53d17911cc6c3498",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若枠号为6～8,则速度、耐力\\n与力量超大幅提升；\\n在终盘时直线加速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ea764ea1a5eef6c942eb4a8cb988cde014753409d884817988557acc408e8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720bf9a7e1c120f52b867fe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中队伍合计发动过6次以上技能\\n则终盘加速度小幅提升并回复持久力；\\n若发动过10次以上技能,本技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d57df03d2bf3f21dc7454b3d2fdf32e047424d884d6bdfa8f1e69d8c526c0fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08253045bff30ba67b1b3e6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时向前方大幅直线突进\\n同时恢复持久力,并且加速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4651bf290eb387dc7c5e5c384c953a9563ed7e56ff1c16b4802b38854268f204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a183a8296047521b86a9c0a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45ae78773ed10f3b4ac50b7bd0aa0c0b347b26253864644fa1c88a0c606eb97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c3d996d800c5b9c342f42d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时加速度会提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6abdb8dbf4c561832f3ca2214a64ffa88e141d1d5157541b647ff4153aa41de8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1400021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d627897fa6bc04eed319e5f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会变得擅长顺时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "36189735050687a2aeb544f2bc44406a2826749825ce8a20815129da88936620",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6847d4cea5247e0878b8eb1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "稍微擅长顺时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "805f8e361712214b93ecbf3d7cd1ca3c48dce065d17fe2e4d80c0e56a673b133",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c618c016bb953a7f569191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "稍微不擅长顺时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "25fc7b05e37d44902038469a3e5e737d05f4c58c07b9d9b429c6d803f5eb939f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e04ad50cca5960b883c8bf5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长顺时针赛道\\n速度和力量上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10eb274bff167b1b9c8a552e35a05e1210900730ea34d3e9465c782eb5fa1bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81dd6763b184d24eeae43928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长逆时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01b5d2550946ef2e2fba201ab4a0058d654da670ce08e7021a6cbecfeb5cde1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26231f47e7238cb46b6fac24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "稍微擅长逆时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "e531bab3e5600c12429746311a555b1d4c0ec0ffcbd40483b951f5392116e72d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0261b369e15314d6e5598880",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "稍微不擅长逆时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "74823e963cff3ae43bb650a2d3d018338b080bebee2f8eacdf239bdbfa5dd28b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24baca69c1831924c34e31c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "变得擅长逆时针比赛\\n提升速度和力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7fe0fbe069b7df11748d1bf206b9dd2fd65323c644fe0f8f788ed80bab9103b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1232f8a2b6ca5ee2a5879a2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长东京竞马场的比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "de5ca301811bd557b80cef86270738fac669783855eacb164c92f8864fa97a70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
